judge_reuse.default:
Review this conversation metadata for repeated work, repeated search failures, expensive recurring tool traces, durable domain knowledge, or a workflow that would be cheaper and more reliable as a reusable capability. Do not evolve for a one-off task. Treat at least three independently observed repetitions and an explicit project statement that the work will recur as real reuse evidence, especially when a deterministic capability would keep bulky raw input or noisy tool output out of the parent context. Use the trajectory-derived usage totals as the authoritative cost evidence; do not infer whole-run token cost from the length of an individual read/write tool result. Still choose no change when direct work is already cheaper, equally reliable, and equally compact. Prefer knowledge for stable facts, a skill/tool for a repeatable operation, and a Harness/SubDAG for an isolated multi-step workflow. The new capability must have a clear trigger, bounded interface and evidence of expected reuse.

Metadata (including exact accumulated trajectory usage when available):
{conversation_payload}

Return ONLY JSON: {{"should_evolve":true|false,"reason":"...","search_query":"...","artifact_type":"knowledge|skill|tool|harness","name":"snake_case_name","spec":{{"purpose":"...","inputs":{{}},"outputs":{{}},"acceptance_test":"..."}}}}

judge_verification.default:
Judge whether the attempted capability evolution is installed/reused and verified by concrete evidence. A proposal, successful write alone, or self-claim is insufficient. For executable Skills require a successful creation/activation result AND a passing runnable acceptance check against the persisted artifact itself; testing copied or equivalent inline code is insufficient. For Knowledge require inspection of the persisted artifact; for a Harness require validation or a runnable smoke test; for activation require a catalog result confirming the selected capability. The runtime has already rejected failed verification-tool evidence before this call. Base the answer on all raw evidence as well as the report.

