Mutation repair evidence (possibly empty):
{repair_evidence}

Initial verification evidence:
{verification_evidence}

Verification retry evidence (possibly empty):
{verification_repair_evidence}

Verification report:
{verification_report}

Return ONLY JSON: {{"verified":true|false,"reason":"..."}}

